\"/wiki/%E8%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"讣告人\"><img alt=\"讣告人\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-303701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/44/HeadIconSmall-303701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%AE%A3%E5%91%8A%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"讣告人\">讣告人</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.4</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>永不沉没号</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：303703</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能一</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能二</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/技能一.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/技能一 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/技能二.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/技能二 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3037/303703/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\"><i>“这场旅途，我们只邀请特别的客人。”</i><br />途经地：复活节岛-百慕大群岛-亚特兰蒂斯<br /><br />复活节岛：<br />一个只停留在过去，没有未来的岛屿。文明在它的土地上留下了令人惊叹的奇迹。<br />登船指南：为了您的安全，请不要擅自与船员搭话。<br /><br />百慕大群岛：<br />无数传说的发源地，在耸人听闻的故事之中，体验一场亲身经历的奇迹。<br />登船指南：如果在C区舞池附近听到哭声，请勿惊慌。船员们会在深夜进行一些娱乐活动，部分船员在生前有演唱歌曲的爱好。<br /><br />亚特兰蒂斯：<br />旅程的最后一站，波赛多尼亚，大西洲不可或缺的明珠。<br />登船指南：切勿投喂船员！本游轮对后果概不负责！<br /><br />启航日期：1991.1.15（大洋洲日环食）<br />登船信物：船长亲笔邀请函</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"303703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/50/Belonging-303704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">幽蓝船长帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Navy Tricorne Hat</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶三角帽，卷羽微微颤动，仿若神秘的意志潜藏其中。<br />它出现在一个普通的清晨，为受访者带来遥远的呼唤、计划之外的远航，以及一份延伸的职责。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/34/Belonging-303705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“尽头”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Bloom of the End\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一朵死去的珊瑚，沉甸甸地落在肩头，如亡者的指与骨。受访者解释其本质是花，生命历经变化、沉积，直至尽头的尽头，不再凋零的花。<br />因此，她仍会珍重地将其捧起。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-303706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/92/Belonging-303706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“一生”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Lifetime\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚蝾螺类化石，壳中灌满渺远的风声与未闻的遗言。<br />“它打捞自海壑更深处，低诉着爱、悔恨，以及夙愿。直到它们的呢喃停息为止，我都将一直航行。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 永不返航1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 永不返航2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%8D%E8%BF%94%E8%88%AA2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">永不返航 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Voyage with No Return</small></span></span>"}}